From 955a87c1c3c7a546afdb834132ce40b44cbb957e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Durham <amdnative@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 02:11:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] hyundai: comma pedal (gas interceptor) longitudinal for
 non-SCC ICE cars

Separate safety mode (hyundai_gas_interceptor), not hyundai_longitudinal: TX = base + 0x200 only,
button engagement, 0x201 RX check enforces pedal crc8 + counter. Car layer: detect 0x201 (capability
flag) + explicit HyundaiGasInterceptor opt-in param before enabling; pedal messages in their own DBC
(BO_ 512 collides with EMS20 in hyundai_can). Accelerator only; thresholds are TBD-BENCH placeholders.
